EO:11644,FRDOC:E8-12839,E8-12839,Notice,2008-06-11,73 FR 33111,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,3,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2008/06/11/E8-12839.txt,ef55240693992529c8141d44bddb3d647a0c262ee74fd1f0b76f744edb8754d3,"Executive Order 11644, issued in 1972 and amended by Executive Order 11989 in 1977, states that Federal agencies allowing ORV use must designate the specific areas and trails on public lands on which the use of ORVs may be permitted, and areas in which the use of ORVs may not be permitted."
