EO:12724,FRDOC:2020-28856,2020-28856,Notice,2020-12-30,85 FR 86651,termination,ending,True,False,False,,2,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2020/12/30/2020-28856.txt,998d8af01660f2110b73194fc7824fc328414c9c699d7bf40df0548c4567b553,"On August 2, 1990, the President issued Executive Order 12722, ``Blocking Iraqi Government Property and Prohibiting Transactions with Iraq.'' On August 9, 1990, the President issued Executive Order 12724, ``Blocking Iraqi Government Property and Prohibiting Transactions with Iraq.'' On July 29, 2004, the President issued E.O. 13350, ``Termination of Emergency Declared in Executive Order 12722 With"
