EO:12770,FRDOC:98-32882,98-32882,Rule,1998-12-11,63 FR 68648,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,2,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1998/12/11/98-32882.txt,e5aa9edf891a8a6d8b3e458524ff2ccdb2e0131aa9f75ed8a7691582ccf84670,Another commenter questioned whether the change in metric system format would be contrary to the national effort to convert to the metric system and not in compliance with Executive Order 12770.
EO:12770,FRDOC:98-5888,98-5888,Rule,1998-03-12,63 FR 12152,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1998/03/12/98-5888.txt,d8140ed6df6ba39fa91a90e8b07f75252482e3474ab2f06a3d51279a3d9fa3e8,"The Metric Conversion Act of 1975, as amended by the Omnibus Trade and Competitiveness Act of 1988 (15 U.S.C. 205) and implemented by Executive Order 12770 (3 CFR, 1991 Comp., p. 343), states that: (1) The metric system is the preferred measurement system for U.S. trade and commerce."
EO:12770,FRDOC:99-23016,99-23016,Rule,1999-09-15,64 FR 50140,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1999/09/15/99-23016.txt,ee66dfd7062fe8df5ada1f17e3cd07861cf5eca3340c0ffaf94248a1f7d670f4,"Throughout the rule, units of measurement are provided in metric forms as well as corresponding conventional unit values, in accordance with the Metric Conversion Act of 1975, as amended by Public Law 100- 418, at 15 U.S.C. 205b; and Executive Order 12770, ``Metric Usage in Federal Government Programs'' (56 FR 35801, July 25, 1991)."
EO:12770,FRDOC:99-23031,99-23031,Proposed Rule,1999-09-16,64 FR 50334,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1999/09/16/99-23031.txt,1222dac604933777a5e15de60846026b4f121d1f5802143d87b0c593ad676e85,"NASA follows the provisions of Executive Order 12770, ``Metric Usage in Federal Government Programs.'' NASA's policy with respect to the metric measurement system is stated in NASA Policy Directive (NPD) 8010.2, Use of the Metric System of Measurement in NASA Programs."
