EO:12861,FRDOC:94-27900,94-27900,Uncategorized Document,1994-11-14,,continuation,continuing,True,False,False,,2,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1994/11/14/94-27900.txt,a58ef30aa104c30ca0ff4370ea292538cfaf4570291ea6f56d10ade676e1d038,"In fact, through a recent final rulemaking published on May 10, 1994 (59 FR 24357), the Department eliminated approximately ten percent of the DEAR, and is continuing its efforts to comply with Executive Orders 12861 and 12866 through an extensive regulatory analysis."
