EO:12919,FRDOC:E9-5498,E9-5498,Notice,2009-03-13,74 FR 10952,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2009/03/13/E9-5498.txt,c225f4574d3f49dd5c159e7b4468cac883df3e1ae76a5341130a067981b49eb4,"Under Executive Order 12919, National Defense Industrial Resources Preparedness, June 3, 1994, Part VI, Section 601, the Administrator of the Federal Emergency Management Agency (FEMA) coordinates the NDER program activities of departments and agencies with NDER units."
