EO:12979,FRDOC:E9-22206,E9-22206,Proposed Rule,2009-10-13,74 FR 52542,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2009/10/13/E9-22206.txt,d977bdb3ab0a8fd7ae7dbee5146a2fda4bb923224c96ab8d85b0f55a8ef7f772,Protest Decision Authority means agency officials above the level of the contracting officer who have been designated by the Procurement Executive to issue agency protest decisions under Executive Order 12979.
