EO:12989,FRDOC:96-33198,96-33198,Rule,1997-01-02,62 FR 224,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1997/01/02/96-33198.txt,bd6c0eb02365da04a055302f0036aebef0eb533df78fd4292d6780fb9d9e9496,"The final rule amends FAR 9.406 to specify that a contractor may be debarred upon a determination by the Attorney General that the contractor is not in compliance with the employment provisions of the Immigration and Nationality Act. The rule implements Executive Order 12989, Economy and Efficiency in Government Procurement Through Compliance With Certain Immigration and Naturalization Act Provisi"
