EO:13058,FRDOC:E8-30180,E8-30180,Rule,2008-12-19,73 FR 77517,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,3,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2008/12/19/E8-30180.txt,298557fbfbbe41fea99661b07ba0a5f852c8db30f354a7966da32d2cf941c58a,"In accordance with the requirements of E.O. 13058, GSA Bulletin FPMR D-245 prohibited the smoking of tobacco products in all interior space owned, rented or leased by the executive branch of the Federal Government, except in specially-equipped designated smoking areas, outdoor areas in front of air intake ducts and certain other residential and non-Federal occupied space."
