EO:13099,EO:13886,2019-19895,Presidential Document,2019-09-12,84 FR 48041,cross_reference,mention,False,False,True,True,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2019/09/12/2019-19895.txt,df476a6906a4f6347c5f70b7f0e198542c2ff12be29790b24cbdc6304eddeb71,"Accordingly, I hereby terminate the national emergency declared in Executive Order 12947 of January 23, 1995, and revoke Executive Order 12947, as amended by Executive Order 13099 of August 20, 1998."
EO:13099,FRDOC:2020-04851,2020-04851,Rule,2020-03-10,85 FR 13746,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,3,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2020/03/10/2020-04851.txt,e6a74cbc4b925b0b9632838757ed11cae3eb1bcd9160d4c2d5a2cc71f1e195eb,"On August 20, 1998, the President issued Executive Order 13099, ``Prohibiting Transactions With Terrorists Who Threaten To Disrupt the Middle East Peace Process'' (E.O. 13099), amending the Annex to E.O. 12947 in order to take additional steps with respect to the national emergency declared in E.O. 12947."
