EO:13148,FRDOC:03-6582,03-6582,Proposed Rule,2003-03-21,68 FR 13872,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2003/03/21/03-6582.txt,030c15fcd1d96eb49ce3f953f2a2c942a1e870c392d55b6d0800f0ba045be799,"Under Executive Order 13148, revised April 26, 2000 (65 FR 24599), all of federal facilities are to comply with the provisions set forth in Section 313 of EPCRA and section 6607 of the PPA. Federal facilities are to comply with those provisions without regard to SIC or NAICS delineations."
