EO:13889,FRDOC:2020-09673,2020-09673,Notice,2020-05-06,85 FR 26979,termination,ending,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2020/05/06/2020-09673.txt,02a69a14f873914a87080bf7b11a4056cb839db0f434d0d436c6ec37645869f6,"In December 2000, the President delegated responsibility for funding, staffing, and operating the Advisory Board to HHS, which subsequently delegated this authority to the CDC. NIOSH implements this responsibility for CDC. The charter was issued on August 3, 2001, renewed at appropriate intervals, and rechartered under Executive Order 13889 on March 22, 2020, and will terminate on March 22, 2022."
