EO:14063,FRDOC:2023-02036,2023-02036,Proposed Rule,2023-02-22,88 FR 11308,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2023/02/22/2023-02036.txt,c184190f1116598ddd8e3ddfbe77a4adc09f21e34bda39ab3fec7494f18873dc,"Legal Authority: 40 U.S.C. 121(c); 10 U.S.C. ch. 137; 51 U.S.C. 20113 Abstract: DoD, GSA, and NASA are amending the Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR) to implement Executive Order 14063 on the use of project labor agreements in connection with large-scale construction projects to promote economy and efficiency in Federal procurement."
