EO:14243,FRDOC:2026-08217,2026-08217,Notice,2026-04-28,91 FR 22844,modification,modifying,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2026/04/28/2026-08217.txt,34613c0f23fe23f1d06c8c222bb6862485819fd0213ccf38631f09516285a643,"SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION: Pursuant to the Privacy Act of 1974, 5 U.S.C. 552a and Executive Order 14243 Stopping Waste, Fraud, and Abuse by Eliminating Information Silos, HUD is modifying the Routine Uses applicable to multiple Department systems of records to enhance interagency coordination, program integrity and performance, and financial accountability."
