EO:5327,FRDOC:00-30443,00-30443,Notice,2000-11-29,65 FR 71119,revocation,ending,True,False,False,True,2,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2000/11/29/00-30443.txt,46d6e1c5c65c43f03fb245a615dc3db2de7febe60be8a46cac1dfbe03f7155ce,"This proposed revocation only pertains to oil shale lands withdrawn under Executive Order 5327 dated April 15, 1930, as amended, and Public Land Order 4522 dated September 13, 1968, as amended, and involves approximately 600,000 acres in Colorado."
